,"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MagnifyGesture"},{"type":"text","text":" (Origami’s magnification\/pinch input)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drives two "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" nodes that flip the shape between its base and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enlarged state; the switch state feeds a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":" Transform Scale, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scale, centered on the magenta artboard.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/on